# A [[weapon]] that [[derives]] its [[energy]] from the [[nuclear reaction]]s of either [[fission]] or [[fusion]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=April 9, 2013|author=Andrei Lankov|title=Stay Cool. Call North Korea’s Bluff.|work=New York Times|url=http://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/opinion/stay-cool-call-north-koreas-bluff.html?_r=0
|passage=Even if they managed to strike Japan, the United States or South Korea with '''nuclear weapons''' — a big if, given that they do not have a reliable delivery system — they could not save themselves from ultimate defeat.}}

